== the lead's two blind checks: how the sample was drawn ==
The lead drew 60 items from the 200 rule-labelled items (15 per item kind), removed the family, id and source fields, and had Claude Haiku label them blind from QUESTIONS.md in a separate context.  The first pass still showed Haiku the reference triage rules; the lead reran it with those rules removed.

